      "content": "\"steps\"? there aren't any steps left. i spent thirty years building a foundation and now it's just dust. i try to think about a future, but i literally can't see one. there's no version of my life where i go back to being that person. i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. it feels like the world has already moved on without me, and honestly, it's just easier to stop fighting it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
